        "children": [],
        "diagramPlacement": "right-of-prompt",
        "answer": {
          "short": "Tangent: $y=0$. Normal: $x=1$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dy}{dx}&=3x^2-3\\\\m_{\\mathrm t}&=3(1)^2-3\\\\m_{\\mathrm t}&=0\\end{align*}$$\nTangent:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-0&=0(x-1)\\\\y&=0\\end{align*}$$\nThe tangent is horizontal, so the normal is vertical through $P(1,0)$: $x=1$.",
